1. **A chemical mechanical polishing apparatus comprising:**

a turntable configured to rotate about an axis and having a polishing surface supporting a polishing pad;

a polishing-agent supply configured to supply a polishing agent from a storage tank onto the polishing surface;

a waste-liquid receiver **secured to the turntable so as to rotate together with the turntable**, the waste-liquid receiver being disposed to collect used polishing agent flowing from the polishing surface; and

a return flow path communicating with the waste-liquid receiver and the storage tank, the return flow path being configured to return the collected used polishing agent from the waste-liquid receiver to the storage tank for reuse.
